abstract: |
  ST-ECR is a modular deep learning architecture for uncertainty-aware 
  multi-asset portfolio allocation in non-stationary environments. 
  The system elevates epistemic uncertainty from a passive output to an 
  active computation routing signal across memory retrieval, representation 
  adaptation, and portfolio allocation decisions.
keywords:
  - deep learning
  - uncertainty quantification
  - portfolio optimization
  - spatio-temporal forecasting
  - selective prediction
  - epistemic uncertainty
